# Summary
The list of countries provided by the client after reviewing the 90 days logs typiclly from where they are frequently seeing logs and which was unexpected was; 
the locations were: Argentina, China, Russia, Ukraine, United Arab Emirates, Saudi Arabia, Spain, Japan, Taiwan, Singapore.

# Alert logic
FROM Ingress_logs
WHERE
    country IN (
        "Argentina",
        "China",
        "Russia",
        "Ukraine",
        "United Arab Emirates",
        "Saudi Arabia",
        "Spain",
        "Japan",
        "Taiwan",
        "Singapore"
    )
    OR
    country_code IN (
        "AR",
        "CN",
        "RU",
        "UA",
        "AE",
        "SA",
        "ES",
        "JP",
        "TW",
        "SG"
    )

## Note: This is the only code part of it, rest is different conditions which we need to select to configure the alert.
